 🩸 Child Leukemia Detection & Smart Appointment System

 📌 Overview

A Django-based healthcare web application that helps patients book doctor appointments and uses Deep Learning to detect childhood leukemia stages from blood cell images.

The system integrates AI-powered medical image classification, doctor appointment management, online payment simulation, and role-based dashboards for Admin, Doctor, and Customer.

---

 🚀 Problem Solved

Traditional leukemia diagnosis requires expert manual analysis and takes time.
This system provides:

* Faster leukemia stage prediction using AI
* Easy doctor appointment booking
* Secure patient-doctor interaction
* Digital healthcare workflow automation

---

 🧠 ML / Deep Learning Model Used

* TensorFlow / Keras CNN Model
* Pre-trained model file: `leukemia_model.h5`

 Predicted Classes

* Benign → Normal Cell
* Early → Early Stage ALL
* Pre → Pre-B ALL
* Pro → Pro-B ALL

---

 📊 Dataset Used

Blood cell microscopic image dataset for leukemia classification.

Image Size: `224 x 224`

Classification Type: Multi-Class Image Classification

