 ✨ Features

 👤 Customer Module

* Registration & Login
* Book doctor appointments
* View appointment status
* Online payment simulation
* Upload blood cell image
* View leukemia prediction result

---

 👨‍⚕️ Doctor Module

* Registration & approval system
* Manage appointments
* Approve consultations
* Set consultation fees
* View patient requests

---

 🛠️ Admin Module

* Approve / Reject doctors
* Manage customers
* Monitor system activities

---

 🩸 AI Leukemia Detection

* Upload blood cell image
* Image preprocessing using OpenCV
* CNN-based prediction
* Confidence score display
* Leukemia stage diagnosis

---

 ⚙️ Model Workflow

1. Image Upload
2. Resize to 224×224
3. Normalize pixel values
4. CNN prediction
5. Leukemia stage classification
6. Confidence score output

---

 📈 Results

* High multi-class prediction accuracy
* Confidence score provided for each prediction
* Real-time diagnosis prediction

---

